sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant EventBridge
  participant StepFunctions
  participant Discovery
  participant Worker
  participant MemberAccount
  participant S3
  participant DynamoDB
  EventBridge->>StepFunctions: Scheduled execution
  StepFunctions->>Discovery: Enumerate selected OUs
  Discovery->>S3: targets.json
  Discovery->>DynamoDB: Run and account targets
  StepFunctions->>Worker: Distributed account item
  Worker->>MemberAccount: AssumeRole
  Worker->>MemberAccount: Describe Regions and network inventory
  Worker->>S3: Checksummed Region shards
  Worker->>DynamoDB: Target success or failure
  StepFunctions->>S3: Final manifest and latest pointer
